WEBVTT

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:01.240
Tolong selamatkan ayahku

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.400
(Episode 70)

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:02.200
Selamatkan dia, ya?

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:03.400
Hmph

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.960
Orang mati, 
gak bisa hidup lagi 

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:06.960
Gak, gak, gak

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.320
Kudengar kemampuan Dokter Yurgi luar biasa

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:10.160
bisa hidupkan 

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:11.240
orang mati

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:12.200
Hahaha

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:15.760
Itu cuma legenda

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:16.840
Aku gak bisa

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:17.800
Lagi pula

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:20.200
dia bertaruh nyawa dengan Tuan Linken?

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:21.920
Apa hubungannya denganku?

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:24.200
Bukannya Tuan Linken

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:26.480
bisa hidupkan 
orang mati?

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:28.720
Kamu, 
bisa minta padanya 

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:30.440
Tuan Linken

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:32.320
Tuan Linken, 
selamatkan ayahku 

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:34.000
Kamu bilang bisa selamatkan dia

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:35.040
Selamatkan dia

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:36.920
Iya, aku memang 
bilang begitu

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:38.200
Aku mohon 
cepat bertindak!

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:42.560
Waktunya hampir habis

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:43.320
Dokter Dikta

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:45.200
Tuan Linken 

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:48.320
Kalau begitu, silakan Dokter Dikta obati dia

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:50.880
Jangan

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:51.600
Aku...

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:52.240
Aku...

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:53.800
Aku gak sehebat itu 

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:55.680
Lagi pula orangnya sudah mati

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:57.520
Luka di jantung 
seperti ini

00:00:57.520 --> 00:00:59.360
gak mungkin bisa diselamatkan lagi

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:00.080
Kalaupun

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:02.680
dia menusuk dirinya 
di meja operasi

00:01:02.680 --> 00:01:04.840
dia gak akan sempat diselamatkan

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:08.560
Tuan Linken, Anda jangan mencelakaiku

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:10.720
Maksudku

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:12.040
kakiku gak leluasa

00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:14.080
tolong Dokter Dikta gantikan aku obati dia

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:17.000
Aku akan beritahu caranya

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:18.400
Ah, baik, baik

00:01:19.960 --> 00:01:20.760
Aduh

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:22.400
Ini...

00:01:22.520 --> 00:01:23.640
Bagaimana ini?

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:26.120
Apa dia sudah dingin?

